spec sk12-no-phantom-no-non-repeatable: 2 sessions, 20 permutations
# SK12. s1 counts :L twice in one transaction; s2 inserts one :L node, deletes
# another, and commits. Both of s1's counts must be equal in every interleaving:
# no phantom and no non-repeatable read under snapshot isolation (F1).

